Tidak.

573
00:31:23,381 --> 00:31:24,883
Tidak, Nathan.

574
00:31:25,383 --> 00:31:27,385
Bagiku masa lalu tak penting.

575
00:31:29,137 --> 00:31:30,305
Itu tak penting.

576
00:31:35,226 --> 00:31:36,060
Itu…

577
00:31:36,686 --> 00:31:37,770
Ya, itu penting.

578
00:31:51,409 --> 00:31:52,869
Jackie akan datang?

579
00:31:55,914 --> 00:31:57,248
Kau sudah di jalan?

580
00:31:57,332 --> 00:32:00,668
Aku tahu aku tak perlu memberitahumu
dilarang kirim pesan saat mengemudi.

581
