00:33:34,262 --> 00:33:35,930
Bagus. Sekarang.

605
00:33:45,356 --> 00:33:46,607
Sedikit lebih pelan.

606
00:33:47,316 --> 00:33:49,402
- Ganti persneling lagi.
- Aku bisa.

607
00:33:59,620 --> 00:34:00,538
Masuk.

608
00:34:03,207 --> 00:34:04,250
Hai, Katherine.

609
00:34:05,001 --> 00:34:06,544
Kenapa kemari, Richard?

610
00:34:07,295 --> 00:34:08,838
Aku ingin bicara denganmu.

611
00:34:12,258 --> 00:34:14,260
Maaf soal kandang ayammu.

612
00:34:15,553 --> 00:34:20,475
Tidak untuk mendepak George dan aku
dari proyek atau mengesampingkan Will?

613
00:34:20,558 --> 00:34:23,227
Kita perlu segera balik modal,

614
00:34:23,311 --> 00:34:24,979
